        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "06edcade-2de8-539b-b538-296aa46e3646",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Johnny Pacar, Polly Frame, Aly Michalka, Alessandra Torresani, Ambyr Childers, Toby Hemingway, Jonathan Keltz, Jennifer Missoni, Christian Slater\n- Works: Flight 29 Down, Make It or Break It, Now You See It..., American Dreams, Playback, Bunnytown\n- Organizations: Disney Channel, ABC Family\n- Places: Edinburgh, Scotland\n- Roles: Cody Jackson, Damon Young, Jimmy Francis, Pinky Pinkerton\n\nFacts:\n- Johnny Pacar was born Johnny Edward Pacuraru on June 6, 1981.\n- Polly Frame was born in 1976 in Edinburgh, Scotland.\n- Johnny Pacar is an American film and television actor and musician of partial Romanian descent.\n- Now You See It... is a 2005 Disney Channel Original Movie.\n- Now You See It... is told from Allyson's point of view, and Allyson is played by Aly Michalka.\n- Johnny Pacar is best known for playing Cody Jackson in Flight 29 Down and Damon Young in ABC Family's Make It or Break It.\n- Johnny Pacar also starred in the Disney Channel Original Movie Now You See It... and had a recurring role as Jimmy Francis in American Dreams.\n- Playback stars Alessandra Torresani, Ambyr Childers, Johnny Pacar, Toby Hemingway, Jonathan Keltz, Jennifer Missoni, and Christian Slater.\n- Polly Frame is a Scottish actress best known to children for playing Pinky Pinkerton, the hyperactive sports announcer on Disney Channel's pre-school series Bunnytown.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
