        "text": "Page: Johnny Pacar. Sentence: Johnny Pacar (born Johnny Edward Pacuraru; June 6, 1981) is an American film and television actor and musician of partial Romanian descent who is best known for his roles as Cody Jackson in the television series \"Flight 29 Down\" and as Damon Young on ABC Family's television series \"Make It or Break It\".\nPage: Johnny Pacar. Sentence: He also starred in the Disney Channel Original Movie \"Now You See It...\", and had a recurring role as Jimmy Francis in \"American Dreams\".\nPage: Now You See It.... Sentence: Now You See It... is a 2005 Disney Channel Original Movie.\nPage: Now You See It.... Sentence: The film is told from Allyson's (Aly Michalka) point of view, similar to a documentary.\nPage: Playback (film). Sentence: The film stars Alessandra Torresani, Ambyr Childers, Johnny Pacar, Toby Hemingway, Jonathan Keltz, Jennifer Missoni, and Christian Slater.\nPage: Polly Frame. Sentence: Polly Frame (born in 1976) is a Scottish actress who was born in Edinburgh, Scotland and is best known to children as Pinky Pinkerton, the hyperactive sports announcer on Disney Channel's pre-school television series \"Bunnytown\".",
